WEBVTT

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.726
And after about 15 or 20 minutes of this,

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.115
she got up and she came across the room,

00:02:34.139 --> 00:02:36.059
and she took me by the hand,

00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:39.257
and she said, "Come on, Bryan.
You and I are going to have a talk."

00:02:39.281 --> 00:02:42.561
And I remember this
just like it happened yesterday.

00:02:42.585 --> 00:02:44.480
I never will forget it.

00:02:44.504 --> 00:02:47.862
She took me out back and said,
"Bryan, I'm going to tell you something,

00:02:47.886 --> 00:02:49.943
but you don't tell anybody
what I tell you."

00:02:49.967 --> 00:02:51.122
I said, "OK, Mama."

00:02:51.146 --> 00:02:53.461
She said, "Now, you make sure
you don't do that."

00:02:53.485 --> 00:02:54.639
I said, "Sure."

00:02:54.663 --> 00:02:57.210
Then she sat me down and she looked at me,

00:02:57.234 --> 00:03:00.484
and she said, "I want you to know
I've been watching you."